      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$25$ is a perfect square.\n\nExpress the statement above in formal language.",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that \"$25$ is a perfect square\" means the following:\n\nThere exists an integer $n$ such that ${n}^{2}=25.$\n\nMore formally, this reads as follows:\n\n$∃\\,n\\in Z,\\,{n}^{2}=25$",
