    "q-183556": {
      "dom_id": "step-q183556",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "$512$ is a power of base $2.$\n\nExpress the statement above in formal language.",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that \"$512$ is a power of base $2$\" means the following:\n\nThere exists an integer $k$ such that ${2}^{k}=512.$\n\nMore formally, this reads as follows:\n\n$∃\\,k\\in Z,\\,{2}^{k}=512$",
